# Course identity: map-coordinate fixture to existing node for room 114.
# No node assignment, completion, exit, sprite, event or save edits.
# Clean-session input route shared by reference and native hosts.
# No WRAM pokes or imported savestates. All waits are guest-frame counts.
wait 600
dump title
press start 2
wait 180
dump files
press start 2
wait 900
dump intro
press b 30
wait 180
press a 30
wait 180
poke 1f11 0000
poke 1f17 e8018801e8018801
poke 1f1f 1e0018001e001800
poke 0100 0b
wait 240
dump node
press y 2
until 0100 == 14 500
dump active
wait 120
dump later
quit
